**`labels_<YOUR_ID>.csv`**, with these columns:
`item_id,L1,confidence,evidence_locators,rationale`

**`report_<YOUR_ID>.md`**, in Bengali, covering:
- method;
- label distribution;
- hard cases;
- limitations;
- boundary incidents.

