1: openapi: 3.0.3
2: info:
3:     title: Gravitee.io APIM - Management API - Analytics
4:     description: |-
5:         This API allows to query analytics data from the Gravitee.io APIM.
6: 
7:         The API provides three types of data representations:
8: 
9:         - **Measures**: Return aggregated values for specified metrics
10:         - **Facets**: Group data by facet values with optional sorting and limits, eventually leading to measures.
11:         - **Time Series**: Return data points over time with optional grouping by facet, eventually leading to measures.
12: 
13:         Each endpoint allows to query multiple metrics at once within a time range, following the same top-level filters, parameters and dimensions.
23: 
24: tags:
25:     - name: computation
26:       description: Analytics computation operations for data processing and aggregation
27:     - name: definition
28:       description: Gravitee analytics definition containing metrics, facets and filters that can be used to query analytics data.
29:     - name: dashboards
30:       description: Custom dashboard management operations for creating, reading, updating, and deleting analytics dashboards
31: servers:
32:     - url: "/management/v2"
33:       description: APIM Management API v2 - Default base URL
34:     - url: "/management/v2/organizations/{orgId}"
35:       description: APIM Management API v2 - Base URL to target specific organizations
36:       variables:
37:           orgId:
38:               description: The unique ID of your organization
39:               default: DEFAULT
