337:     /environments/{envId}/analytics/facets:
338:         post:
339:             operationId: queryFacets
340:             summary: Query facets analytics
341:             description: |
342:                 Group data by facet values with optional ranging, sorting and limits.
343: 
344:                 Facet requests are limited to 3 dimensions in the by clause.
345: 
346:                 Sorting and ranging always apply to the last given facet.
347: 
348:             tags:
349:                 - computation
350:             parameters:
351:                 - $ref: "#/components/parameters/EnvId"
352:             requestBody:
353:                 description: |
354:                     A facets request is a request to obtain measures grouped by facet.
355: 
356:                       - Each metric follows the same top-level facets, limits and order.
357: 
358:                       - Each facet can be in turn grouped by one facet to provide a multi-dimensional representation of the data.
359: 
360:                       - Facets are represented as a tree of facet buckets, following the order given in the `by` clause of the request.
361: 
362:                       - Additional filters can be applied at the metric level, allowing to refine the representation of the metric.
403: 
404:             responses:
