1246:                 - MIN
1247:                 - MAX
1248:                 - P50
1249:                 - P90
1252:                 - COUNT
1253:                 - RPS
1254:                 - PERCENTAGE
1255:             description: Measure name identifier. Represents the type of measure/aggregation applied to a metric.
1256:             example: "COUNT"
