1582:         WidgetType:
1583:             type: string
1584:             enum:
1585:                 - stats
1589:                 - top
1590:                 - bar
1591:                 - line
1592:             description: |
1593:                 The type of widget visualization.
1594: 
1595:                 - **stats**: A single number KPI / stat widget displaying aggregated values.
1596:                 - **doughnut**: A doughnut chart widget for displaying proportional data.
1597:                 - **pie**: A pie chart widget for displaying proportional data.
1598:                 - **polarArea**: A polar area chart widget for displaying proportional data with varying radii.
1599:                 - **top**: A top-N ranking widget for displaying the highest values.
1600:                 - **bar**: A bar chart widget for displaying comparative data across categories.
1601:                 - **line**: A line chart widget for displaying data over time or across categories.
1608:                 - rows
1609:                 - x
1610:                 - y
1611:             description: Layout positioning and sizing of a widget within the dashboard grid.
1612:             properties:
1613:                 cols:
1614:                     type: integer
1615:                     minimum: 1
1616:                     description: Number of columns the widget spans
1617:                     example: 1
1618:                 rows:
1619:                     type: integer
1620:                     minimum: 1
1621:                     description: Number of rows the widget spans
1622:                     example: 1
1623:                 x:
1624:                     type: integer
1625:                     minimum: 0
1626:                     description: Horizontal position (column index) in the grid
1627:                     example: 0
1628:                 y:
1629:                     type: integer
1630:                     minimum: 0
1631:                     description: Vertical position (row index) in the grid
1632:                     example: 0
1633:             example:
1634:                 cols: 1
1635:                 rows: 1
1636:                 x: 0
1637:                 y: 0
