1639:         WidgetRequest:
1640:             type: object
1642:                 - type
1643:                 - timeRange
1644:                 - metrics
1645:             description: |
1646:                 Defines the analytics request associated with a widget. This determines what data the widget displays.
1647: 
1648:                 The `type` field selects the analytics request type. The structure aligns with the computation request schemas (see computation tag):
1649:                 - **measures**: Returns aggregated values. Same shape as `MeasuresRequest` (timeRange, metrics, filters).
1650:                 - **facets**: Groups data by facet values. Same shape as `FacetsRequest` (timeRange, by, metrics, limit, filters, ranges).
1651:                 - **time-series**: Returns data points over time. Same shape as `TimeSeriesRequest` (timeRange, interval, metrics, by, limit, filters, ranges).
1652:             properties:
1653:                 type:
1654:                     type: string
1656:                         - measures
1657:                         - facets
1658:                         - time-series
1659:                     description: The type of analytics request this widget represents (measures, facets, or time series)
1660:                     example: "measures"
1661:                 timeRange:
1662:                     $ref: "#/components/schemas/TimeRange"
1663:                 metrics:
1664:                     type: array
1665:                     minItems: 1
1666:                     items:
1667:                         $ref: "#/components/schemas/MetricRequest"
1668:                     description: |
1669:                         List of metric requests to process. Uses `MetricRequest` which supports metric name, measures, and optional filters.
1670:                 interval:
1671:                     $ref: "#/components/schemas/Interval"
1672:                 by:
1673:                     type: array
1674:                     maxItems: 3
1675:                     items:
1676:                         $ref: "#/components/schemas/FacetName"
1677:                     description: List of facet names to group by. Required when type is `facets`, optional for `time-series`, not applicable for `measures`.
1678:                 limit:
1679:                     type: integer
1680:                     minimum: 1
1681:                     description: Maximum number of buckets to return. Applicable when type is `facets` or `time-series`.
1682:                 filters:
1683:                     type: array
1684:                     items:
1685:                         $ref: "#/components/schemas/Filter"
1686:                     description: Top-level filters applied to all metrics in this widget request.
1687:             example:
1688:                 type: "measures"
1689:                 timeRange:
1690:                     from: "<redacted>"
1691:                     to: "<redacted>"
1692:                 filters:
1693:                     - name: "API"
1694:                       operator: "EQ"
1695:                       value: "7b6ebef3-6236-4ac5-815e-d3dcef83df5d"
